      "why": "Only pipelined families can deliver 1 result/cycle and therefore meet >=250 MSPS. Pipelined (m=1) gives the highest Fmax and is the safest bet for the throughput constraint. Search around the minimum widths/iterations that can reach 2^-13 accuracy (W>=14, N~10-20) to minimise LUTs."
    },
